OL,3,GNEWSABody of baby girl may have been in
OL,4,Athe water for weeks, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a baby girl found along a
OL,7,Fnorth Wales shoreline may have been in
OL,8,Fthe water for up to a few weeks,
OL,9,Faccording to initial indications.
OL,11,FA member of the public found the body
OL,12,Fon the Menai Strait shoreline near
OL,13,FSiliwen Road in Bangor, Gwynedd, on
OL,14,FSunday shortly before 17:00 BST.
OL,16,FIn an update on Thursday, North Wales
OL,17,FPolice said a post-mortem examination
OL,18,Frevealed the newborn was a girl.
OL,20,FThe force is continuing the search for
OL,21,Fthe girl's mother and urged her to make
OL,22,Fcontact with police.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
